.Dd January 22, 2024
.Dt RZ_AX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rz-ax
.Nd rizin numeric base converter
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm rz-ax
.Op Fl AabBcdDeEfFhiIjkKlmMnNopPrRsStTuUvVwWxXyYzZ
.Op Ar expression ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This command is part of the Rizin project.
.Pp
.Nm
is a base conversion utility that can convert numbers between different
representations such as decimal, hexadecimal, binary, octal, floating point,
strings, and more.
.Pp
Multiple flags can be combined to perform chained conversions.
If no flag is specified, the default output is hexadecimal.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl a
Convert ASCII to hexadecimal
.It Fl A
Convert hexadecimal to ASCII
.It Fl b
Convert binary to hexadecimal
.It Fl B
Convert hexadecimal to binary
.It Fl c
Convert signed decimal to hexadecimal
.It Fl C
Convert hexadecimal to signed decimal
.It Fl d
Convert decimal to hexadecimal
.It Fl D
Convert hexadecimal to decimal
.It Fl e
Convert big endian to little endian
.It Fl E
Convert little endian to big endian
.It Fl f
Convert float to hexadecimal
.It Fl F
Convert hexadecimal to float
.It Fl h
Show help message
.It Fl i
Convert IP address to hexadecimal
.It Fl I
Convert hexadecimal to IP address
.It Fl j
Output in JSON format
.It Fl k
Convert hexadecimal to decimal with signed interpretation
.It Fl K
Convert decimal to hexadecimal with signed interpretation
.It Fl l
Convert string length
.It Fl m
Convert memory size (K, M, G, T suffixes)
.It Fl M
Convert hexadecimal to memory size
.It Fl n
Convert decimal to octal
.It Fl N
Convert octal to decimal
.It Fl o
Convert octal to hexadecimal
.It Fl O
Convert hexadecimal to octal
.It Fl p
Convert physical address to hexadecimal
.It Fl P
Convert hexadecimal to physical address
.It Fl r
Swap byte order (reverse)
.It Fl R
Rotate bits right
.It Fl s
Convert string to hexadecimal
.It Fl S
Convert hexadecimal to string
.It Fl t
Convert time to hexadecimal
.It Fl T
Convert hexadecimal to time
.It Fl u
Convert unsigned decimal to hexadecimal
.It Fl U
Convert hexadecimal to unsigned decimal
.It Fl v
Show version information
.It Fl V
Verbose mode
.It Fl w
Convert wide string to hexadecimal
.It Fl W
Convert hexadecimal to wide string
.It Fl x
Force hexadecimal output
.It Fl X
Force uppercase hexadecimal output
.It Fl y
Convert Base64 to hexadecimal
.It Fl Y
Convert hexadecimal to Base64
.It Fl z
Pad output with zeroes
.It Fl Z
Strip leading zeroes
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Convert decimal to hexadecimal:
.Pp
.Nm rz-ax Fl d Cm 1234
.Pp
Convert hexadecimal to ASCII:
.Pp
.Nm rz-ax Fl A Cm 68656c6c6f
.Pp
Reverse endianness:
.Pp
.Nm rz-ax Fl r Cm 0x12345678
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rz-asm 1 ,
.Xr rz-bin 1 ,
.Xr rz-diff 1 ,
.Xr rz-find 1 ,
.Xr rz-gg 1 ,
.Xr rz-hash 1 ,
.Xr rz-run 1
